constraints:
1 ≤ x ≤ 10^{7}

expected time complexity: O(log N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def floorSqrt(self, x):
		st = 0
		en = x
		while st <= en:
			mid = (st + en) // 2
			if mid * mid == x:
				return int(mid)
			elif mid * mid < x:
				st = int(mid + 1)
			else:
				en = int(mid - 1)
		return int(en)
